      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this beautifully maintained three bedroom detached bungalow, enjoying a fabulous location in the highly sought after Seapark Development. Presented in immaculate condition throughout, this attractive home offers the discerning purchaser an excellent opportunity to acquire a turnkey property in this mature and well-established residential setting. The property is approached via a gated entrance, with an enclosed front garden bordered by mature hedging and a private driveway providing valuable off street parking. Access to the rear landscaped private garden is via a gated entrance, complemented by a spacious patio area enjoying a sunny aspect, creating an ideal setting for outdoor dining and entertaining. A particular feature of this property is its proximity to Abbeyside Cove and Beach and direct access to the Waterford Greenway providing an enviable opportunity for outdoor recreation right on your doorstep. The location is further enhanced by its proximity to an extensive range of amenities, including creche facilities, primary and secondary schools, shops, restaurants, pubs and numerous sporting facilities. Easy access to the N25 and N72, in addition to excellent transport links, also make Seapark an ideal base for commuters. The deceptive accommodation comprises: Entrance Hallway, Livingroom, Kitchen/Dining Area, 3 Bedrooms, Shower Room. External Block build shed, Garden shed. REA Spratt highly recommend viewing of this home. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n Bright spacious hallway\n\nSitting Room\n3.50m x 4.01m Wooden floor, electric fire.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area\n6.66m x 3.06m Tiled floor, floor and eye level units, island\n\nBedroom 1\n3.96m x 3.10m Laminate floor, Fitted wardrobe .\n\nBedroom 2\n3.10m x 3.03m Laminate floor.\n\nBedroom 3\n2.79m x 3.04m Carpet floor, built in wardrobe.\n\nWet Room\n1.98m x 1.99m WC, Fully tiled.\n\nGarage\n3.08m x 3.04m Block built\n\nShed\n2.04m x 2.02m\n\n\nOutside\n-Enclosed front and rear landscaped gardens bordered by mature hedging. -Spacious patio area enjoying a sunny aspect -Gated entrance to private driveway providing off street parking"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Well maintained bungalow residence\n*Fabulous location in the well established Seapark Development \n*Adjacent to the Waterford Greenway, Abbeyside Cove and Beach nearby\n*Within a short walk of Dungarvan Town Centre \n*All essential and social amenities are nearby \n*Easy access to N25/N72 making it an ideal commuter base\n-\nAll light fittings, window furnishings, floor coverings, integrated applances. \n -All Mains Services\n-O.F.C.H.\n \n All amenities of Dungarvan Town on the doorsstep"
